    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just constant. i look at his side of the bed and i just feel like i'm already gone. like i'm just a ghost wandering around a house that doesn't belong to me anymore. it's exhausting trying to find a reason to keep going when the only person i wanted to be with is gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
